    {
      "name": "quote_mv_render",
      "title": "Quote the full video render",
      "description": "Estimates how many credits it costs to render the whole video from the storyboard (character images, scene images, scene videos and final assembly), and whether the account has enough. Charges nothing and changes nothing. The quote is valid for 15 minutes. Tell the user the number of credits and ask for confirmation before calling start_mv_render.",
